    "title": "Omaha Crash Near 96th and Jefferson Leaves One Critically Injured - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve Braddock ,\n2 days ago A crash near 96th and Jefferson Streets in Omaha left one person critically injured and another seriously hurt Monday afternoon, authorities say. The collision happened around 3:15 p.m. and sent one victim to a local hospital with traumatic injuries, while the second person was also seriously hurt. The cause of the crash remains under investigation. Read full article\n2",
